id: pm-rl-zcqf
title: "Release gate omits operational scripts, full-history identities, lint, and duplication"
description: "The configured exact coverage gate measures index.ts and series.ts only while three executable TypeScript scripts remain outside instrumentation. release:check has no raw Git object identity audit, and the reachable history currently contains two distinct non-GitHub-noreply addresses without printing their values. No explicit ESLint or jscpd-equivalent gate exists. Publishing must remain blocked until these independent quality and privacy contracts are implemented."
type: Issue
status: closed
priority: 0
tags[8]: coverage,docstrings,duplication,git-history,lint,privacy,release-blocker,typescript
