notes[3]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-08-08T11:43:17.028Z",pi-agent,"Started work. Installed eslint@^10.8.1, @babel/core@^8.0.1, @babel/eslint-parser@^8.0.1, @babel/plugin-syntax-typescript@^8.0.3, jiti@^2.7.0, jscpd@^5.0.14 as devDependencies. Current state: no lint, no duplication check, no identity audit, scripts excluded from coverage."
  "2026-08-08T11:45:02.529Z",pi-agent,"Lint: 0 violations found (ESLint with Babel parser, TS7-compatible). Duplicates: 1 clone found in series.ts (0.36% lines, 68 tokens) - extracted buildMetricEvent() shared helper to eliminate it. After fix: 0% duplication. Identity audit: ported audit-git-identities.ts from pm-vcs, approved 3 addresses (1153461+unbraind noreply, noreply@github.com, stefan@preu.at as intentional public authoring identity)."
  "2026-08-08T12:44:42.491Z",pi-agent,"Finished the in-progress gate work and made every gate pass. Fixes to the inherited tests: corrected 4 nested-closure 'dir possibly null' reads in coverage-gate.test.ts (captured dir.root into a local const, the audit test's proven pattern); fixed a contradictory eqeqeq assertion in quality-scripts.test.ts (asserted ===undefined then ok-truthy; the config is ['error','always']); corrected the docstring-violation regex (symbol: reason, not symbol - reason); and made three isMainInvocation tests use real temp files (the launcher fails closed on non-existent paths via realpathSync). Coverage-gate.ts: made resolveEmitPaths/computeRequired accept an injectable show-config (consistent with runGate's injectable spawn) so the tsc-failure and type-only-ignore branches are reachable, and cleaned tsc's ./ prefixes so outDir/rootDir are stable; exported defaultSpawn for direct coverage. Replaced the self-recurse 'main runs the gate against the real repository' test (it spawned this test file) with non-recursive main() tests. Mutation-verified each new gate fails when its guard is violated: lint (explicit any -> exit 1), duplicates (a cloned function -> 1 clone over 0% threshold -> exit 1), audit:identities (drop approved stefan@preu.at -> rejects 1 non-public address -> exit 1), coverage-scripts (add an untested executable script -> 99.74% under 100% -> exit 1). All restored green. Final: typecheck/build/lint/duplicates/docstring/coverage/audit:identities all pass; coverage 100% lines/branches/functions across 8 source files."
