close_reason: "All release gates green and mutation-verified. typecheck, build, lint (0 violations), duplicates (0 clones, 0.00%), docstring (8 files/49 declarations documented), coverage (8 source files at 100% lines/branches/functions), and audit:identities (3 approved addresses) all pass. Each new gate was proven to fail on a real violation (any, a code clone, an unapproved identity, an untested script) then restored. scripts/*.ts and the raw git-object identity audit are now inside release:check; stefan@preu.at remains an approved public authoring identity."
